sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Server
    participant Database

    Client->>Server: HTTP Request
    Server->>Database: SELECT query
    Note over Database: 慢查询 10s...

    Client--xServer: 客户端断开
    Note over Server: 服务端不知道<br/>还在傻等

    Note over Database: 查询完成
    Database-->>Server: 返回结果
    Note over Server: 结果已无用<br/>但 goroutine 已卡住 10s
